{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48824","headline":"和汴州令狐相公白菊 · 杨巨源","name":"和汴州令狐相公白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兔园春欲尽，别有一丛芳。\n直似穷阴雪，全轻向晓霜。\n凝晖侵桂魄，晶彩夺萤光。\n素萼迎风舞，银房泫露香。\n水晶帘不隔，云母扇韬鋩。\n纨袖呈瑶瑟，冰容啓玉堂。\n今来碧油下，知自白云乡。\n留此非吾土，须移凤沼傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}